---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Sign-Making Supplies & LED Products | Manchester" description="Find sign-making supplies from Manchester Sign Group, including print service, adhesives, RGB lights, white lights and power supplies. Delivery throughout the United Kingdom.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>SUPPLIES FOR SIGN MAKERS</small><h1>SIGN-MAKING <em>SUPPLIES</em></h1><p>Explore sign-making materials and lighting products for sign makers, installers and businesses.</p></div>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Products for sign-making projects</h2><p>Manchester Sign Group offers a selection of sign-making supplies and lighting products. The current shop includes print service, glue and adhesives, RGB lights, white lights and power supplies. Product suitability depends on your project and the specifications of the items you need.</p><p>If you are unsure which product is suitable, send us the intended use and any relevant technical details before ordering. For electrical components, confirm voltage, power requirements and compatibility with your setup.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Delivery throughout the United Kingdom</h2><p>We are based in Manchester and offer delivery throughout the United Kingdom. Contact us to confirm product availability, delivery details and any compatibility questions before placing an order. All products include a one-year warranty.</p></section>
    <div class="page-actions"><a href="/shop/">BROWSE THE SHOP →</a><a class="secondary" href="https://wa.me/447594106206?text=Hi%20Manchester%20Sign%20Group%2C%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20sign-making%20supplies." target="_blank" rel="noopener">ASK ABOUT A PRODUCT →</a></div>
    <nav class="related"><strong>Need a finished sign?</strong><a href="/3d-signs/">3D signs</a><a href="/rgb-signs/">RGB 3D signs</a><a href="/neon-signs/">Neon signs</a><a href="/flat-signs/">Flat signs</a></nav>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:65px 0 85px}.page-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 14px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p,.content-card p{color:#aaa;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.content-card{padding:22px 24px;margin:14px 0;background:#0c0f11;border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:12px}.content-card h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}.content-card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.page-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.page-actions a{padding:15px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#ff1730;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.page-actions .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #444}.related{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:28px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #303437}.related strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.related a{color:#ff6677;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:600px){.inner-page{padding:45px 0 65px}.content-card{padding:18px}.content-card h2{font-size:19px}.page-head h1{font-size:46px}}
</style>